msgid "1-MP global-shutter colour + FLIR Lepton thermal on one module."
msgstr ""
"1 kamera global-shutter berwarna MP + FLIR Lepton termal dalam satu modul."

msgid "1.8–5.5V battery input via a DC barrel jack."
msgstr "Input baterai 1,8–5,5V melalui konektor DC barrel jack."

msgid "10 Mb/s differential serial for industrial buses."
msgstr "Serial diferensial 10 Mb/s untuk bus industri."

msgid "10/100 Ethernet with Power-over-Ethernet."
msgstr "Ethernet 10/100 dengan Power-over-Ethernet."

msgid "2.3\" SPI LCD with capacitive multi-touch and Qwiic."
msgstr "LCD SPI 2,3\" dengan layar sentuh multi-touch kapasitif dan Qwiic."

msgid "5MP HDR sensor — high dynamic range for tough lighting."
msgstr "Sensor HDR 5MP — rentang dinamis tinggi untuk pencahayaan yang sulit."

msgid "5MP rolling-shutter colour + FLIR Lepton thermal on one module."
msgstr ""
"5MP kamera rolling-shutter berwarna + FLIR Lepton termal dalam satu modul."

msgid "6µA standby motion trigger plus white and 850 nm IR."
msgstr "Pemicu gerak siaga 6µA ditambah cahaya putih dan IR 850 nm."

msgid "8 Mb/s CAN-FD plus 1 Mb/s RS-232 in one shield."
msgstr "CAN-FD 8 Mb/s ditambah RS-232 1 Mb/s dalam satu shield."

msgid ""
"<code>find_blobs</code> returns connected pixel regions matching one or more"
" LAB thresholds."
msgstr ""
"<code>find_blobs</code> mengembalikan wilayah piksel yang terhubung yang "
"cocok dengan satu atau lebih ambang batas LAB."

msgid ""
"<code>ml.utils.draw_skeleton</code> draws all 21 joints and connections in "
"one call."
msgstr ""
"<code>ml.utils.draw_skeleton</code> menggambar semua 21 sendi dan koneksi "
"dalam satu panggilan."

msgid ""
"<code>pixels_threshold</code> filters tiny detections; "
"<code>merge=True</code> joins overlapping blobs."
msgstr ""
"<code>pixels_threshold</code> menyaring deteksi kecil; "
"<code>merge=True</code> menggabungkan blob yang tumpang tindih."

msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Referensi API"

msgid "Adapter for FLIR Boson / Boson+ — higher-resolution thermal."
msgstr "Adapter untuk FLIR Boson / Boson+ — termal resolusi lebih tinggi."

msgid "Adapter for FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x thermal cores."
msgstr "Adapter untuk inti termal FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x."

msgid ""
"Add-on boards that plug into the OpenMV Cam — networking, motor control, "
"displays, and more."
msgstr ""
"Papan tambahan yang terhubung ke OpenMV Cam — jaringan, kontrol motor, "
"layar, dan lainnya."

msgid "Add-ons"
msgstr "Add-on"

msgid "Alif Ensemble E3 — fusion-class Cortex-M55 with Ethos-U55 NPU."
msgstr "Alif Ensemble E3 — Cortex-M55 kelas fusi dengan NPU Ethos-U55."

msgid "AprilTag tracking"
msgstr "Pelacakan AprilTag"

msgid ""
"AprilTags are 2D fiducial markers — robust to motion blur and partial "
"occlusion, and they give you full 3D pose."
msgstr ""
"AprilTag adalah penanda fiducial 2D — tahan terhadap motion blur dan oklusi "
"sebagian, dan memberikan pose 3D penuh."

msgid "Async Bluetooth Low Energy — peripherals, advertising, and GATT."
msgstr "Bluetooth Low Energy asinkron — periferal, advertisi, dan GATT."

msgid "Back to top"
msgstr "Kembali ke atas"

msgid "Bar code detection"
msgstr "Deteksi kode batang"

msgid "BlazeFace tracking"
msgstr "Pelacakan BlazeFace"

msgid "Boards"
msgstr "Papan"

msgid ""
"Bring your own YOLOv8 model trained on <a "
"href=\"https://roboflow.com\">Roboflow</a> and load it the same way."
msgstr ""
"Bawa model YOLOv8 Anda sendiri yang dilatih di <a "
"href=\"https://roboflow.com\">Roboflow</a> dan muat dengan cara yang sama."

msgid "Built-in detector — no model file or training needed."
msgstr "Detektor bawaan — tidak memerlukan file model atau pelatihan."

msgid ""
"Camera control: pixel formats, frame sizes, exposure, gain, and white "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Kontrol kamera: format piksel, ukuran bingkai, eksposur, gain, dan "
"keseimbangan putih."

msgid "Camera modules"
msgstr "Modul kamera"

msgid ""
"Camera modules and sensor adapters that plug into the board-to-board "
"connector — colour, monochrome, thermal, and event-based vision."
msgstr ""
"Modul kamera dan adapter sensor yang terhubung ke konektor board-to-board — "
"visi berwarna, monokrom, termal, dan berbasis event."

msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Changelog"

msgid ""
"Click the socket-icon connect button in the IDE, then hit the green play "
"arrow to run your first script."
msgstr ""
"Klik tombol sambungkan ikon soket di IDE, lalu tekan tanda panah putar hijau"
" untuk menjalankan skrip pertama Anda."

msgid "Color tracking"
msgstr "Pelacakan warna"

msgid "Community &amp; links"
msgstr "Komunitas &amp; tautan"

msgid "Community discussion, help, and project sharing."
msgstr "Diskusi komunitas, bantuan, dan berbagi proyek."

msgid "Compact 23 × 23 mm STM32H747 board with on-board sensor."
msgstr "Papan STM32H747 kompak 23 × 23 mm dengan sensor bawaan."

msgid ""
"Compiler, runtime, native modules, and porting MicroPython to new MCUs."
msgstr "Kompiler, runtime, modul native, dan portasi MicroPython ke MCU baru."

msgid "Connect your cam"
msgstr "Sambungkan kamera Anda"

msgid "Cooperative multitasking — run camera, network, and I/O in parallel."
msgstr ""
"Multitasking kooperatif — jalankan kamera, jaringan, dan I/O secara paralel."

msgid "Copy page"
msgstr "Salin halaman"

msgid "Core libraries"
msgstr "Pustaka inti"

msgid "Detect faces with BlazeFace"
msgstr "Deteksi wajah dengan BlazeFace"

msgid "Differences from CPython"
msgstr "Perbedaan dari CPython"

msgid "Discussion"
msgstr "Diskusi"

msgid ""
"Download and install OpenMV IDE for Windows, macOS, or Linux and launch the "
"IDE."
msgstr ""
"Unduh dan instal OpenMV IDE untuk Windows, macOS, atau Linux dan jalankan "
"IDE."

msgid ""
"Drive up to 4 servos drawing up to 5A while powering the camera, 6–36V "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Gerakkan hingga 4 servo dengan daya hingga 5A sambil memberi daya pada "
"kamera, input 6–36V."

msgid "Each result also exposes version, ECC level, and corner coordinates."
msgstr "Setiap hasil juga mengekspos versi, level ECC, dan koordinat sudut."

msgid ""
"Each result has format, payload, rotation, corners, and a bounding rect."
msgstr ""
"Setiap hasil memiliki format, payload, rotasi, sudut, dan kotak pembatas."

msgid "Edit this page"
msgstr "Edit halaman ini"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Contoh"

msgid "Explore by board"
msgstr "Jelajahi berdasarkan papan"

msgid "Explore →"
msgstr "Jelajahi →"

msgid "External"
msgstr "Eksternal"

msgid "Find 1D barcodes anywhere in the frame and decode their payloads."
msgstr ""
"Temukan kode batang 1D di mana saja dalam bingkai dan dekode payload-nya."

msgid "Find blobs of color"
msgstr "Temukan blob warna"

msgid "Find your board"
msgstr "Temukan papan Anda"

msgid "Firmware, IDE, and example sources — issues and pull requests welcome."
msgstr "Firmware, IDE, dan sumber contoh — isu dan pull request disambut."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"For OpenMV firmware v%(omv)s &middot; based on MicroPython v%(mpy)s &middot;"
" docs built %(date)s &middot; Copyright &copy; 2014-2026 by OpenMV, Damien "
"P. George, and others."
msgstr ""
"Untuk firmware OpenMV v%(omv)s &middot; berdasarkan MicroPython v%(mpy)s "
"&middot; dokumen dibuat %(date)s &middot; Hak Cipta &copy; 2014-2026 oleh "
