"Untuk firmware OpenMV v%(omv)s · berdasarkan MicroPython v%(mpy)s · dokumen "
"dibuat %(date)s"

msgid "Forums"
msgstr "Forum"

msgid "GENX320 event sensor + PAG7936 colour on one module."
msgstr "Sensor event GENX320 + warna PAG7936 dalam satu modul."

msgid "Gigabit Ethernet with PoE for higher-bandwidth streaming."
msgstr "Ethernet Gigabit dengan PoE untuk streaming bandwidth lebih tinggi."

msgid ""
"Google's BlazeFace is a lightweight TensorFlow Lite face detector that "
"returns bounding boxes plus six landmarks per face."
msgstr ""
"BlazeFace milik Google adalah detektor wajah TensorFlow Lite ringan yang "
"mengembalikan kotak pembatas ditambah enam landmark per wajah."

msgid ""
"Google's MediaPipe Hand Landmarks model places 21 joints on each detected "
"hand — wrist, knuckles, and fingertips."
msgstr ""
"Model Hand Landmarks MediaPipe milik Google menempatkan 21 sendi pada setiap"
" tangan yang terdeteksi — pergelangan tangan, buku jari, dan ujung jari."

msgid "Hand landmarks"
msgstr "Landmark tangan"

msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "Perangkat keras"

msgid ""
"Hardware, cameras, image processing, ndarrays, ML, multitasking, networking,"
" web servers, and Bluetooth — all from MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"Perangkat keras, kamera, pemrosesan citra, ndarray, ML, multitasking, "
"jaringan, server web, dan Bluetooth — semua dari MicroPython."

msgid "Hello world"
msgstr "Hello world"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Beranda"

msgid "Internals"
msgstr "Internal"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

msgid "Language reference, syntax, and core runtime semantics."
msgstr "Referensi bahasa, sintaks, dan semantik runtime inti."

msgid "Libraries"
msgstr "Pustaka"

msgid "License"
msgstr "Lisensi"

msgid ""
"Live face detection, AprilTag tracking, QR scanning, and YOLO. All on-device"
" in pure MicroPython. No host computer, no cloud."
msgstr ""
"Deteksi wajah langsung, pelacakan AprilTag, pemindaian QR, dan YOLO. Semua "
"di perangkat dalam MicroPython murni. Tanpa komputer host, tanpa cloud."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/blazeface_front_128.tflite</code> — pre-quantised, no"
" download needed."
msgstr ""
"Dimuat dari <code>/rom/blazeface_front_128.tflite</code> — sudah "
"dikuantisasi, tidak perlu diunduh."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/hand_landmarks_full_224.tflite</code> — running "
"standalone here, without palm detection upstream."
msgstr ""
"Dimuat dari <code>/rom/hand_landmarks_full_224.tflite</code> — berjalan "
"mandiri di sini, tanpa deteksi telapak tangan sebelumnya."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/yolov8n_192.tflite</code> — no SD card or download "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Dimuat dari <code>/rom/yolov8n_192.tflite</code> — tidak memerlukan kartu SD"
" atau unduhan."

msgid "Locate and identify AprilTags"
msgstr "Temukan dan identifikasi AprilTag"

msgid "Low-level hardware: GPIO, SPI, I²C, UART, PWM, ADC, and timers."
msgstr ""
"Perangkat keras tingkat rendah: GPIO, SPI, I²C, UART, PWM, ADC, dan timer."

msgid "Machine vision,<br>made simple."
msgstr "Visi mesin,<br>dibuat sederhana."

msgid "Machine vision: blobs, edges, lines, circles, features, and drawing."
msgstr "Visi mesin: blob, tepi, garis, lingkaran, fitur, dan penggambaran."

msgid ""
"Made with <a href=\"https://www.sphinx-doc.org/\">Sphinx</a> using the <a "
"href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">Shibuya theme</a>."
msgstr ""
"Dibuat dengan <a href=\"https://www.sphinx-doc.org/\">Sphinx</a> menggunakan"
" <a href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">tema Shibuya</a>."

msgid "Made with the <a href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">Shibuya theme</a>."
msgstr "Dibuat dengan <a href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">tema Shibuya</a>."

msgid "MicroPython on GitHub"
msgstr "MicroPython di GitHub"

msgid "Minimal HTTP server — routes, sessions, login, SSE, and WebSockets."
msgstr "Server HTTP minimal — rute, sesi, login, SSE, dan WebSocket."

msgid "Monochrome global-shutter sensor for fast-motion capture."
msgstr "Sensor global-shutter monokrom untuk pengambilan gerak cepat."

msgid "More actions"
msgstr "Tindakan lainnya"

msgid "More resources"
msgstr "Sumber daya lainnya"

msgid "NXP i.MX RT1062 Cortex-M7 at 600 MHz with 32 MB external SDRAM."
msgstr "NXP i.MX RT1062 Cortex-M7 pada 600 MHz dengan 32 MB SDRAM eksternal."

msgid "New"
msgstr "Baru"

msgid "New to OpenMV?"
msgstr "Baru mengenal OpenMV?"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Berikutnya"

msgid "No privacy concerns — frames never leave the camera."
msgstr "Tidak ada masalah privasi — bingkai tidak pernah meninggalkan kamera."

msgid "Numeric, alphanumeric, binary, and Kanji data modes."
msgstr "Mode data numerik, alfanumerik, biner, dan Kanji."

msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

msgid "On-device neural network inference — classify, detect, and segment."
msgstr ""
"Inferensi jaringan saraf di perangkat — klasifikasi, deteksi, dan "
"segmentasi."

msgid "On-device numerical computing — ndarrays, FFTs, and linear algebra."
msgstr "Komputasi numerik di perangkat — ndarray, FFT, dan aljabar linear."

msgid "Open in ChatGPT"
msgstr "Buka di ChatGPT"

msgid "Open in Claude"
msgstr "Buka di Claude"

msgid "Open in Perplexity"
msgstr "Buka di Perplexity"

msgid "Open the IDE"
msgstr "Buka IDE"

msgid "OpenMV MicroPython internals"
msgstr "Internal MicroPython OpenMV"

msgid "OpenMV MicroPython language"
msgstr "Bahasa MicroPython OpenMV"

msgid "OpenMV homepage"
msgstr "Beranda OpenMV"

msgid "OpenMV on GitHub"
msgstr "OpenMV di GitHub"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

msgid "Pass multiple thresholds for multi-color tracking in one call."
msgstr ""
"Berikan beberapa ambang batas untuk pelacakan multi-warna dalam satu "
"panggilan."

msgid ""
"Plug the OpenMV Cam into your computer via USB. A blue heartbeat LED blinks "
"when it's ready."
msgstr ""
"Colokkan OpenMV Cam ke komputer Anda melalui USB. LED detak jantung biru "
"berkedip saat siap."

msgid ""
"Powered by the <a href=\"https://github.com/mchehab/zbar\">ZBar</a> library "
"— recognises EAN, UPC, Code&nbsp;39/93/128, Codabar, ITF, ISBN, and DataBar."
msgstr ""
"Didukung oleh pustaka <a href=\"https://github.com/mchehab/zbar\">ZBar</a> —"
" mengenali EAN, UPC, Code&nbsp;39/93/128, Codabar, ITF, ISBN, dan DataBar."

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Sebelumnya"

msgid "Products, applications, downloads, and news."
msgstr "Produk, aplikasi, unduhan, dan berita."

msgid "Prophesee event-based vision — microsecond temporal precision."
msgstr "Visi berbasis event Prophesee — presisi temporal mikrodetik."

msgid "QR code detection"
msgstr "Deteksi kode QR"

msgid "Quick start guide"
msgstr "Panduan mulai cepat"

msgid "Read 1D barcodes"
msgstr "Baca kode batang 1D"

#, python-format
msgid "Read the OpenMV firmware <strong>v%(v)s</strong> changelog"
msgstr "Baca changelog firmware OpenMV <strong>v%(v)s</strong>"

msgid "Real-time person tracking"
msgstr "Pelacakan orang secara real-time"

msgid ""
"Returns ID plus full 6-DoF pose — <code>x/y/z</code> translation and "
"<code>x/y/z</code> rotation."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan ID ditambah pose 6-DoF penuh — translasi <code>x/y/z</code> "
"dan rotasi <code>x/y/z</code>."

msgid "Returns one list per hand — index 0 is left, index 1 is right."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan satu daftar per tangan — indeks 0 adalah kiri, indeks 1 adalah"
" kanan."

msgid "Returns the decoded payload as a Python string — ready to use."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan payload yang didekode sebagai string Python — siap digunakan."

msgid "Run your first script"
msgstr "Jalankan skrip pertama Anda"

msgid "Runs in real time on NPU-equipped boards — the OpenMV N6 and AE3."
msgstr ""
"Berjalan secara real time pada papan yang dilengkapi NPU — OpenMV N6 dan "
"AE3."

msgid "STM32H743 Cortex-M7 with a removable image sensor module."
msgstr "STM32H743 Cortex-M7 dengan modul sensor citra yang dapat dilepas."

msgid "STM32H743 with 32 MB external SDRAM and a 5MP OV5640 sensor."
msgstr "STM32H743 dengan 32 MB SDRAM eksternal dan sensor OV5640 5MP."

msgid "STM32H747 with 8 MB SDRAM and Vision Shield support."
msgstr "STM32H747 dengan 8 MB SDRAM dan dukungan Vision Shield."

msgid "STM32H747 with 8 MB SDRAM, Vision and Display Shield support."
msgstr "STM32H747 dengan 8 MB SDRAM, dukungan Vision dan Display Shield."

msgid "STM32N6 with built-in NPU — STMicro's first AI-accelerated MCU."
msgstr ""
"STM32N6 dengan NPU bawaan — MCU berakselerasi AI pertama dari STMicro."

msgid "Scan QR codes from a live feed"
msgstr "Pindai kode QR dari siaran langsung"

msgid ""
"Select your OpenMV Cam to see its pinout, specs, and board-specific quick "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"Pilih OpenMV Cam Anda untuk melihat pinout, spesifikasi, dan referensi cepat"
" khusus papan."

msgid "Sensors"
msgstr "Sensor"

msgid "Shields"
msgstr "Shield"

msgid "Six keypoints per face: eyes, nose, mouth, and ears."
msgstr "Enam titik kunci per wajah: mata, hidung, mulut, dan telinga."

msgid ""
"Start with the step-by-step tutorial — it covers hardware setup, the IDE, "
"basic scripts, and tips for your first real project."
msgstr ""
"Mulailah dengan tutorial langkah demi langkah — ini mencakup penyiapan "
"perangkat keras, IDE, skrip dasar, dan tips untuk proyek nyata pertama Anda."

msgid "Switch to auto color mode"
msgstr "Beralih ke mode warna otomatis"

msgid "Switch to dark color mode"
msgstr "Beralih ke mode warna gelap"

msgid "Switch to light color mode"
msgstr "Beralih ke mode warna terang"

msgid ""
"The built-in QR decoder handles tilted, distorted, and partially occluded "
"codes."
msgstr ""
"Dekoder QR bawaan menangani kode yang miring, terdistorsi, dan terhalang "
"sebagian."

msgid ""
"The on-board YOLOv8 model is a single-class person detector — int8 quantised"
" and shipped in ROM."
msgstr ""
"Model YOLOv8 bawaan adalah detektor orang satu kelas — dikuantisasi int8 dan"
" disertakan dalam ROM."

msgid "Track 21 hand keypoints"
msgstr "Lacak 21 titik kunci tangan"

msgid "Translations"
msgstr "Terjemahan"

msgid ""
"Tune thresholds for your lighting — disable auto-gain and auto-whitebal "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Sesuaikan ambang batas untuk pencahayaan Anda — nonaktifkan auto-gain dan "
"auto-whitebal terlebih dahulu."

msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "Tutorial"

msgid "Upstream MicroPython firmware sources — what OpenMV builds on top of."
msgstr ""
"Sumber firmware MicroPython hulu — apa yang dibangun OpenMV di atasnya."

msgid "Use a windowed strip in grayscale for the fastest linear scan."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan strip berjendela dalam skala abu-abu untuk pemindaian linear "
"tercepat."

msgid "Use for robotics calibration, AR markers, and indoor positioning."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan untuk kalibrasi robotika, penanda AR, dan penentuan posisi dalam "
"ruangan."

